WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Your AI can think. It can't use your Mac.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Connect the AI apps you already use.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.000
See what it's doing.

00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
Visible, non-focus-stealing browser work.

00:23.000 --> 00:30.000
Hand off work. Get a report back.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
You stay in charge.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Let your AI apps use your Mac. Open source, MIT.
